assignment. A very profitable exercise in life, is to write a ‘simple
statement’ that describes what you believe your life is about. ‘Simple
statement’ does not indicate simplicity in length or lexical
construction, but non-complexion and in-ambiguity in meaning and
interpretation.

Your “Life Statement” is a definition of what you believe your life
and living is essentially about.

