purpose talk foremost about the mindset and consciousness which
should be brought into the actions, activities, jobs, businesses,
practices, careers or paths you engage. So, your Life Statement is not
describing the one thing you will do with your life, rather, it portrays
the mindset and understanding that governs and powers all the
things you will do in life. Life will place many demands and needs,
changing roles and tasks, different paths and multiple activities on
you at different phases of you life. However, as you do all the
different things at the different phases of life as occasion demands,
your life statement should governs your attitude and conviction
about yourself and your life in all that you do. Thereby, it provides
the fulcrum around which your life revolves and stabilizes
irrespective of changing scenarios.

A great number of people talk about how they have several abilities
and do many things thereby not knowing which of them is their
purpose or assignment.

