             Working At The Assignment

The Life Work - Working the Life Assignment

You were sent to the earth on a mission. Identifying and deploying
yourself for the mission(s) is what brings true fulfillment and success.
Work is the term used to describe all efforts to deploy oneself
profitably on earth. Therefore, God sent you to the earth to ‘work’.
However, God’s concept of work is different from many people’s
concept. This chapter will give you the right understanding about work.

What You are Here to do ?

One of the most misunderstood concepts in life is the concept of work.
Unemployment is a great challenge in many nations. People are either
‘looking for work’, ‘out of work’ or ‘not working’. People also work
tirelessly to put ‘food on the table’, people work because they have to
be ‘bread winners’ and because of the scripture that says, ‘whoever does
not work should not eat.’ The subject of work is a serious discourse in
understanding Life Assignment.

The first mention of the word ‘work’ with respect to man in the
Scripture was in the Garden of Eden. The first man was created, given
all the food, shelter and luxury he would ever need in the Garden.

                                                              44
                                             THE LIFE ASSIGNMENT

