food to eat, but to win souls, impact nations and complete his Life
Assignment. Having needs met and material sustenance is a by-product
of work and not the reason for it – great people work tirelessly to build
a destiny and fulfil their assignment. Laziness is one of the worst
destroyers of destiny. The next destroyer of destiny to laziness is
