are currently doing to your destiny. If there is no relevance whatsoever,
God will answer your prayers by re-routing the course of your life into
what you need to be doing now.

At creation, man didn’t work for food (Gen. 2:9, 16). Man worked at
his assignment because that was the reason for his existence.

                                                              47
                                      WORKING AT THE ASSIGNMENT

Working for the purpose of having food to eat and needs to meet came
