the assignment. Financial well-being, family upkeep, mental and
academic development, means of income, spiritual, social and physical
health are all vital components of life. People that neglect the
components of life to be preoccupied about life assignment, often come
short of fulfilling purpose and become a reproach to the aspiration they
claim to pursue.

                                                              55
                                      WORKING AT THE ASSIGNMENT

You must pay attention to every area of your life. And do all that needs
to be done to make a success of your life. The issue of success in life
