slave, executing his will upon the earth. The Kingdom of God on earth
has been subjugated by the kingdom of darkness due to the
carelessness of man - God’s Ambassador to the kingdom of the earth.

Every kingdom is ruled by the principles of the King over it and reflects
the nature and character of its king. Thus, every the wrongs on earth
are a reflection of the nature of satan, sickness, poverty, murder,
immorality, wars (political, international, economical, religious,
between labour capital etc.) God’s assignment is to reclaim the entire
earth; the people, the world and all its systems, the sectors and
eventually the physical earth, from the effects of the rule of satan over
it.

This is why Jesus came The Eternal King was sent to the earth to help
rescue his enslaved regent and to reclaim and re-institute His Kingdom
on the earth. He came as a Man into the enemy conquered earth,
defeated satan and all his cohorts both on the physical realms of the
earth and spiritual realms of the underworld. He took the keys of
dominion and handed it back to man and ascended back to heaven,
having restored man as king.

However, man has been slave for millennia, so he does not know how
to be king anymore. Jesus, in his earthly time on earth had displayed
what kingdom over satan, demons, sickness, poverty, elements of the
earth and the world system looks like.

