The Spheres of the Kingdom

Summarily, the Kingdom of God consists of :

1. The Kingdom of Heaven where the reign of God is uncontested
because His will is perfectly done.

2. The Kingdom of Darkness, which describes the realm of Satan and
his cohorts which have been judged and are destined for destruction.

3. The Kingdom of the Earth. The earth talks about the physical
structure which houses the people and all things on it. The world talks
about the system of people, and activities on earth. Thus the Kingdom
of the World is the social order of all things on the earth. Thus, the
main interest of both God and satan on the earth is the Kingdoms of the
World (Rev. 11: 15). The physical earth itself was created by God with
a tenure and will be destroyed and a new earth will be created (Rev 21:
1).

The Spheres of the Kingdom of the Earth

Your life assignment is to advance the Kingdom in a particular area and
way, by making a unique contribution to God’s reclamation of the
earth, its people, its cultures, systems and principles. You were created,
born again and the Holy Spirit of God was given to you, for you to
know, be trained and empowered for the spheres that you are to reclaim
for God’s Kingdom. When you know what you are to contribute, in
which sphere of human endeavour and life sector to function and how
to do it, such that the Kingdom of God is introduced, propagated,
advanced or

