                       ABOUT THE BOOK

The Life Assignment provides insights into the ultimate reason for
human existence. Gripping life questions like ‘who am I?’, ‘what am I on
earth to do?’, ‘why do I exist?’ and ‘how do I actualise and fulfil my Life
Purpose and Assignment?' are clarified and answered. This book will help
you discover, define, understand and deploy yourself for a fulfilling and
rewarding life.

                             ABOUT THE AUTHOR

                                Davids Oluwaseye Ayodele is a trainer, speaker
                                and writer. He is graced with understanding
                                and presenting complex issues with simplicity
                                and clarity for practical application.

He is the founder of several initiatives both within the Church and the
workplace such as The Wisdom Institute of Leadership and Ministry for
training and equipping Church leaders, ENABLED Multiconcept for
business and professional leadership development and consultancy, and
several other platforms for Bible-based Teaching Ministry. He has a
bachelor's degree in chemical engineering and master's degree in
engineering management from Ahmadu Bello University, Nigeria. He is
married to Deborah OluwaNifemi and they are blessed with children.

